    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="8218a15f-c5f4-5faf-b1a5-72094ebd58c7" activityNameId="6983f12c-ec7c-546e-8c2f-511304957cfc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paraffin, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paraffin, at plant
data based on the ECOSOL study of the European surfactant industry. Allocations in multioutput processes were made, using the relative mass outputs of products.;
Synonyms: wax, Wachs; 
UUID: ffe49bac-1b88-35cd-a9b6-1bb8e98b1b68
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of n-paraffins out of crude oil. Water consumption and infrastructure have been estimated.
Location: Data based on the European paraffin production
Technology: Average technology, typical for European production conditions in the mid 90s
Time period: data of published literature
Production volume: 800 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ffe49bac-1b88-35cd-a9b6-1bb8e98b1b68.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
